  "reasoning": "The defendant 何2某臣 repeatedly made false statements that the township party secretary 杨某 assaulted him, and disseminated these allegations through television, internet and other media, causing serious damage to Yang's reputation. The court found that he had the requisite intent and actus reus for defamation, and the evidence confirmed the false nature of his claims. No other criminal conduct (such as assault) was proven against him. Therefore the appropriate criminal charge is defamation (诽谤).",
